{"v":4,"catch":"你能阻止這個MEIOU計畫嗎？","desc":"《WAR OF AERO》是ALLUMER於1992年發行的射擊遊戲。\n此飛機兩側均可安裝吊艙，可轉動吊艙進行上下射擊。\n此外，當1P和2P飛機相互堆疊時，它們會合併產生強大的攻擊。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-02-29","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a5f7057d77f866c6a712c2d37e644bf15a2266abcc9aa4f6e25d6221d10d153.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/05adfc67c17685215663954b23cbda113c150b0d5f5907ceb29211a40544a9fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ed5de3b74eed8747c37008397bdcf0f9c1ab531aeee47808c2e67bbe677665e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac69c79f703890ac6256eb38be17757adde516b92c72586042e09abe9aa9a626.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19ce8845a9f180cbec61c6ea0ef9452ee8ff8b0ad76063f79c211565aaf8a207.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e222ec5c16d626a6e333b74d2e2b0bde4b769da634b4a5ce48023d03cbfb848f.jpg"],"titleId":"010015901dcfc000","dlc":[]}